{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:02.00] We in motherfuckin' New York, nigga\n[00:05.40] It's like 5 in the morning\n[00:07.20] Pushin' the shades back, looking at the city, this shit look brazy, nigga, uh\n[00:10.94] Alright, haha\n[00:21.06] Double cup when—\n[Verse 1]\n[00:24.04] Double cup when I wake up, Actavis a life-taker\n[00:27.00] Probably meet my maker, smoking exotic flavors\n[00:29.82] If I tote the shotty, I'ma blow the shotty, then I walk around like I don't know nobody\n[00:32.88] Upstairs, groupies waitin' in the lobby\n[00:34.24] Got a girlfriend, sorry, I ain't sorry\n[00:35.96] I ain't come to kick it\n[00:37.38] With any of these bitches\n[00:38.84] See, money, I've been gettin'\n[00:40.44] I fuck up a check, let it blow in the wind\n[00:41.98] Bitch, check my quota, I'm bigger and bolder and better than all of these niggas that's buzzin'\n[00:45.04] If it's a problem, my niggas'll clutch it\n[00:46.46] Pretty nigga, still'd shoot up the function\n[00:48.02] Top of the line, I got my hand on my .9, bitch, I'ma die about mine\n[00:51.06] I was told life was about elevations, just pick you a ladder, and start-up the climb\n[00:54.04] Can't be afraid to take risk after risk, gamble chip after chip, tryna stay on the grind\n[00:57.06] Was in the kitchen, cooked grits, but they weren't really grits, they were bricks, mom, I'm sorry, I lied\n[01:00.44] I can make it up to you this time\n[01:02.58] Bought my mom a car, she listen to my shit while she drive\n[01:05.62] I owe her the world, send disrespect her way, you gotta die\n[01:08.38] Feel the same way about my girl, them diamonds, make 'em twinkle like her eyes (Oh)\n[Chorus]\n[01:11.76] It's one thing to talk about it, another thing to do it (Oh)\n[01:26.92] It's one thing to talk about it, another thing to do it\n[01:30.64] It's one thing to talk about it, another thing to do it\n[01:33.40] It's one thing to talk about it, another thing to do it\n[Verse 2]\n[01:36.06] Breaking pills down, I can't help it, it's a habit now\n[01:38.96] Piped the fuck up, turnt the fuck up, promise, ain't no coming down\n[01:41.78] You'd get burnt the fuck up, choppers on us if you came to fuck around\n[01:45.04] Look for your mom, she in town, giving head for some brown\n[01:48.06] I'm a dog off the leash, bitch, I bite, I don't growl (Hrr, hrr)\n[01:51.08] I don't bark, I'm in silence, I'ma shoot up the crowd\n[01:54.06] If he want smoke, give him cancer, I'm gon' blow him down\n[01:56.94] He ain't know it was a problem, then I bet he know it's a problem now\n[01:59.90] A kid from the trenches, was plottin' on riches, I made it, I did it\n[02:02.10] I'm shinin' on all of these niggas that said that I wouldn't be shit, I was shittin' on them ever since I was in it\n[02:05.88] Don't fuck with the Rémy, the Henny, yeah, none of that\n[02:07.52] I pour the codeine, I sip, ain't no coming back\n[02:09.02] You caught a play, I'ma act like a quarterback\n[02:10.44] Got a hundred in cash, I do not need a quarter back (Oh)\n[Chorus]\n[02:32.90] It's one thing to talk about it, another thing to do it (Oh)\n[03:00.06] It's one thing to talk about it, another thing to do it\n[03:03.44] It's one thing to talk about it, another thing to do it\n[03:07.38] It's one thing to talk about it, another thing to do it","words":[[1.82,1.92,"[Intro]"],[1.94,1.96,"[00:02.00]"],[2.0,2.06,"We"],[2.1,2.12,"in"],[2.18,2.7,"motherfuckin'"],[2.74,2.8,"New"],[2.86,3.12,"York,"],[3.2,3.4,"nigga"],[3.42,4.08,"[00:03.40]"],[5.4,5.52,"It's"],[5.56,5.74,"like"],[5.76,5.8,"5"],[5.98,6.0,"in"],[6.04,6.08,"the"],[6.16,6.48,"morning"],[6.5,7.04,"[00:07.20]"],[7.2,7.46,"Pushin'"],[7.58,7.64,"the"],[7.68,7.8,"shades"],[7.88,8.02,"back,"],[8.06,8.24,"looking"],[8.32,8.38,"at"],[8.44,8.48,"the"],[8.6,8.72,"city,"],[8.76,8.86,"this"],[9.0,9.1,"shit"],[9.16,9.3,"look"],[9.4,9.76,"brazy,"],[9.86,10.0,"nigga,"],[10.26,10.86,"uh"],[10.88,10.9,"[00:14.54]"],[10.94,11.06,"Alright,"],[14.52,14.72,"haha"],[14.74,16.82,"[00:21.06]"],[21.